<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;500.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Store at -20C or 4C in the absence of light. <br>
<I>Wolfe's modified mineral elixir:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Nitrilotriacetic acid                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
